047D   28 03                  JR   Z,er5   
047F                          ENDIF      
047F                          IF   CHECKED*CPM*(1-EDITOR)   
                              CP   1Ah   ; (the ^Z that pads a file's last record ends
                              JR   Z,er5   ;   the text too: some terminals clear the
047F                          ENDIF      ;   screen on it. The editor's loader ends
047F                          IF   CHECKED   ;   the text at the first ^Z.)
047F   EF                     RST   28h   
0480   10 F0                  DJNZ   er4   
