                              JP   endprog   
04D5                          ENDIF      
04D5                          IF   CHECKED*EDITOR   
04D5   C3 22 05               JP   edit0   ; back to the editor, with both stacks cleared
04D8                          ENDIF      
04D8                          IF   CHECKED   
04D8                             ; phalf: print half of HL, and leave it in C.
04D8   CB 3C        PHALF:    SRL   H   
04DA   CB 1D                  RR   L   
